# A MATCH whose own pattern is a CHEAPEST search with a varying COST still cannot have an OPTIONAL MATCH
statement error
FROM GRAPH_TABLE (g MATCH ANY CHEAPEST (a:P)-[e:K COST e.w]->+(b:P) OPTIONAL MATCH (b)-[f:K]->(c:P) COLUMNS (a.id AS a));
----
not supported with OPTIONAL
